s`).\n8\t\n9\t## 2. Pre-Implementation Validation\n10\t- Verify that a spec exists in `/specs/in-progress`.\n11\t- Check `ai-context/architecture.md` for non-negotiable invariants.\n12\t- Ensure no boundary violations (run `node scripts/architecture/validate_boundaries.js`).\n13\t\n14\t## 3. Scoped Execution\n15\t- Implement ONE unit at a time.\n16\t- Use defensive programming (timeouts, retries).\n17\t- Never modify stable logic unnecessarily.\n18\t\n19\t## 4. Post-Implementation Documentation\n20\t- Update `ai-context/current_state.md`.\n21\t- Record lessons in `/memory/lessons-learned.md`.\n22\t- Generate an audit trail in the spec file.\n23\t\n24\t## 5. Verification\n25\t- Run `node scripts/qa/qa_runner.js`.\n26\t- All steps MUST pass before completion.\n27\t\n28\t---\n29\t\n30\t# Deterministic Invariants\n31\t1. **Spec-Driven:** No code without a spec.\n32\t2. **Boundary-Safe:** No UI direct DB calls.\n33\t3. **Memory-Persistent:** Record every failure and lesson.\n34\t4. **Verified:** No completion without QA pass.\n35\t"}], "reasoning_content": null}, {"role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "thinking", "thinking": "Let me explore more of the codebase structure to understand the architecture better. I'll look at the key directories and files.", "signature": ""}, {"type": "text", "text": "<tool_call>Bash<arg_key>command</arg_key><arg_value>ls -la /home/daniel-muhoro/workspace/projects/easytutor/src/</arg_value><arg_key>description</arg_key><arg_value>List src directory</arg_value></tool_call>"}, {"type": "tool_use", "id": "975827a3-6b54-42f7-a443-68b188cb68f7", "name": "Bash", "input": {"command": "ls -la /home/daniel-muhoro/workspace/projects/easytutor/ai-context/", "description": "List ai-context directory"}}, {"type": "tool_use", "id": "134bc28a-7b66-448f-8ee0-1a4f3aeabeed", "name": "Bash", "input": {"command": "ls -la /home/daniel-muhoro/workspace/projects/easytutor/lib/", "description": "List lib directory"}}, {"type": "tool_use", "id": "c57f6510-00e1-4